-/**
- * GLES 3.00 fragment shaders implementing MGC 9.6.080 V24 `gcam::PecanLumaDenoiseS16`
- * (`LumaDenoisePyramidDownsampleS16Halide`, `LumaDenoisePyramidLevelS16Halide`, and
